15. Electronic copy of the Annual Report for the year 2018 and copy of the Notice of the 48 th Annual General Meeting inter alia indicating the process and manner of e-voting alongwith Attendance Slip and Proxy Form are being sent to all the members whose email IDs are registered with the Company/ Depository Participants(s) for communication purposes unless any members has requested for a hard copy of the same.

For members who have not registered their email address, physical copies of the Annual Report for the year 2018 and copy of the Notice of the 48th Annual General Meeting inter alia indicating the process and manner of e-voting alongwith Attendance Slip and Proxy Form are being sent in the permitted mode.

