HUDCO is one of the nominated Central Nodal Agencies of the Government of India for routing the central subsidy to beneficiaries under the Credit Linked Subsidy Scheme (CLSS) component of PMAY (Urban). During the year 2017-18, HUDCO has disbursed a total subsidy amount of ₹ 50.74 crore to 2605 number of beneficiaries of EWS, LIG and MIG categories.

